# Optional dev-only starter values for `npm run dev`.
#
# Since Phase 31, OAuth Client ID/Secret are entered through the onboarding
# wizard and stored locally on the machine:
#   - Client ID + Client Secret -> app_config table (goworks.db). A desktop
#     OAuth secret is a "public client" secret (RFC 8252), so it is kept in
#     plain text; it is required to refresh tokens before the vault is unlocked.
#   - Service Account key + refresh token -> encrypted master-password vault
#     (vault.enc, Argon2id + AES-256-GCM).
#
# You normally do NOT need this file. If you fill it in, the values are migrated
# once into app_config on first launch (electron/config/boot-check.ts).
# Production binaries never read .env.
#
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
